    <string name="phone_bar_note_taskbar" translatable="false">Everything on this page changes it.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_note_map_behind" translatable="false">Its bar has its own look and side, below, and shows the items you choose.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_clock_card_off" translatable="false">The \"Clock and status\" card is off, so the bar shows all of them.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_clock_card_on" translatable="false">On the home screen the \"Clock and status\" card has the clock, battery and weather, so the bar shows only the other items; with an app open, the bar shows them all.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_clock_card_cut" translatable="false">Only %1$d cards fit on this screen and \"Clock and status\" is not among them, so the bar shows all the items. Move that card up on the Cards page to show it.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_clock_card_stage" translatable="false">While the big card shows \"Clock and status\", the clock, battery and weather are there and the bar shows the other items; otherwise the bar shows them all.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_note_dock" translatable="false">The dock shows the items you choose below, and the weather if it is on. Side and the dark bar belong to the Taskbar layout.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_note_classic" translatable="false">Nothing on this page changes it: side, bar items, dark bar and weather belong to other layouts.</string>
    <string name="phone_bar_items_weather_hint" translatable="false">Weather shows only with the Weather switch below on. Outside temperature uses the car\'s own sensor; a car without one needs the Weather switch, and until there is a reading it shows –°.</string>
