    <string name="phone_check_share" translatable="false">Share the log</string>
    <string name="phone_check_private" translatable="false">The shared log leaves out who messages were auto-replied to, Bluetooth device and Wi-Fi names, addresses (a Bluetooth address keeps its last two pairs), e-mails, phone numbers and VINs. The car\'s own name and its certificate\'s name stay. Read it before you send it.</string>
