    <string name="phone_map_what" translatable="false">It recolours everything the maps app draws on its map, its own buttons and speed sign too. It works on colours only, so it cannot tell water from roads, and it costs a little more work per frame.</string>
    <string name="phone_map_with_look" translatable="false">The filter is part of the look: saving a look keeps it, and choosing a look brings its own (or none).</string>
