    <string name="phone_speed_wifi_only" translatable="false">Downloaded on Wi-Fi only unless allowed above, from MyPlay\'s own release page. Looked for again once a month, when MyPlay is opened. Choosing a region, or None, deletes nothing: an old region\'s file goes only once the new one is downloaded, and Delete removes it.</string>
    <string name="phone_speed_hint_only" translatable="false">The limit is a hint; the signs on the road win. OpenStreetMap does not know every limit: it misses road works, variable motorway signs and some limits by time or weather, and a match can be wrong at junctions or on roads side by side.</string>
    <string name="phone_speed_offline" translatable="false">The file is used offline on the phone: the car\'s position is never sent anywhere to find a limit.</string>
    <string name="phone_osm_notice" translatable="false">Speed limit data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0: openstreetmap.org/copyright</string>
