    <string name="phone_teach_waiting" translatable="false">Now press the button in the car. It will do: %1$s.</string>
    <string name="phone_teach_hint" translatable="false">For buttons MyPlay does not know, like the ones round the knob. With the car connected, choose what it should do, tap Teach it, then press the button within 30 seconds. Not Back, the knob, the pad or the call keys.</string>
